# The two bundles scripts/build-vendor.mjs writes on install; ~13 MB, never
# committed. The leading slash matters: an unanchored `vendor/` also matches
# src/engine/vendor/, whose hand-written entry points are the build's *input*.
# Ignoring those made a clean clone unbuildable — see .github/workflows/ci.yml.
/vendor/
